title: "The Mineral Floor: Critical Minerals, Green Technology and the Right to Industrialise"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual (EN/PT) interactive scrollytelling reconstructing the mineral base
  of the green transition as three geographies (reserves, mine production and
  refining) and mapping sixteen critical minerals onto six green value chains.
